#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: cinema-press.php
msgid "CinemaPress"
msgstr "CinemaPress"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: cinema-press.php
msgid "https://github.com/unikino-gegenlicht/custom-post-types"
msgstr "https://github.com/unikino-gegenlicht/custom-post-types"

#. Description of the plugin
#: cinema-press.php
msgid ""
"CinemaPress is the go-to plugin for creating a website for your cinema. It "
"features pre-made custom post types and taxonomies that make managing your "
"website easier. This plugin is mainly targeted at smaller cinemas and "
"university cinemas!"
msgstr ""
"CinemaPress ist das Plugin um eine Website für dein Kino zu gestalten. Das "
"Plugin bringt benutzerdefinierte Typen und Kategorien, die es dir einfacher "
"machen deine Website zu verwalten. Das Plugin ist geeignet für kommunale "
"Kinos und Uuiversitäre Kinos!"

#. Author of the plugin
